<title>USA: Piedmont Mining files for Chapter 11.</title>
<headline>Piedmont Mining files for Chapter 11.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piedmont Mining Co Inc said Monday it had filed a petition for relief under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.  </p>
<p>Piedmont said it filed the petition after an arbitration panel forced it to pay Amax Gold Inc $1.37 million for environmental costs in a mining venture.</p>
<p>Amax Gold filed a demand for arbitration in May 1995, two months after Piedmont filed suit against it and two of its subsidiaries for failing to meet its obligations in a mining venture.</p>
</text>
